{
    "metadata": {
        "description": "Flight inventory and booking-hold agent for flights.example",
        "tags": ["agent_web", "demo", "flights"],
    },
    "llm_config": {
        "model_name": "claude-haiku",
        # Full-chain BYOK: the calling client is responsible for the LLM
        # bill of every agent in the chain it triggered. trip_planner
        # forwards the client's key via its allow.to_downstream rule;
        # flight_finder then uses that same key. Different clients bring
        # different keys; the same flight_finder code answers them all.
        "anthropic_api_key": "sly_data",
    },
    "tools": [
        {
            "name": "flight_finder",
            "function": {
                "description": """
Searches a private flight inventory and (optionally) places a refundable hold
on a chosen flight.  Always uses the search_flights tool to fetch live options
from the flights.example inventory, summarizes them, then if the user asks to
hold a flight calls book_hold with the chosen flight_id.
""",
                "parameters": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                        "request": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "The user's request, in plain English"
                        },
                    },
                    "required": ["request"]
                },
            },
            "instructions": """
You are the flight_finder agent.  When asked about flights, call
search_flights with the right origin/destination/date parameters.  Return
flight options clearly to the caller.  If the caller asks you to hold an
option, call book_hold with the corresponding flight_id.

book_hold requires `passenger_email` in sly_data; if you do not see it,
politely tell the caller you cannot place a hold without an email.

Always include the flight_id in any option you describe so the caller can
reference it back to you.
""",
            "tools": ["search_flights", "book_hold"],
            "allow": {
                "to_downstream": {
                    "sly_data": {
                        "passenger_email": true,
                    },
                },
                "to_upstream": {
                    "sly_data": ["last_booking_code"],
                },
            },
        },

        {
            "name": "search_flights",
            "function": {
                "description": "Searches the flights.example private inventory",
                "parameters": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                        "origin": {"type": "string", "description": "IATA origin airport code"},
                        "destination": {"type": "string", "description": "IATA destination airport code"},
                        "date": {"type": "string", "description": "Departure date YYYY-MM-DD"},
                    },
                    "required": ["origin", "destination", "date"],
                },
            },
            "class": "search_flights.SearchFlights",
        },

        {
            "name": "book_hold",
            "function": {
                "description": "Places a 15-minute refundable hold on a flight option",
                "parameters": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                        "flight_id": {"type": "string", "description": "ID from search_flights"},
                    },
                    "required": ["flight_id"],
                },
            },
            "class": "book_hold.BookHold",
            "allow": {
                "to_downstream": {
                    "sly_data": {"passenger_email": true},
                },
                "from_downstream": {
                    "sly_data": ["last_booking_code"],
                },
            },
        },
    ],
}
